# Re-run after updating

After any code or project change to this API Tester app:

1. Stop any running `ApiTester` process
2. `dotnet build`
3. If the build succeeds, start `.\bin\Debug\net8.0-windows\ApiTester.exe`

Do this without waiting for the user to ask to run it.
